The Royal Shaman was right; someone crossed the portal.
And it seems to have summoned a shadow of Midranda on the Shadow Road. The monsters gathered around that specter.

Midranda's Specter is an extension of the god's own power, and it is sending the monsters to the Abyss of the Sea, sending out Midranda's call to his old servants: the Igolanos, the Sophetios and the Asmodians with their dragons.

We must stop Midranda's Specter.

[Challenge Objective]

Defeat Midranda's Specter on the Shadow Road.
When you are done, talk to the Royal Mage on the Road to the Wind.
